# MikroORM

Follow `.cursor/skills/mikro-orm/SKILL.md` when wiring MikroORM.

Hard rules:

- ORM config and entities stay under `infrastructure/` — never in `domain/`
- Repository **ports** stay in domain; MikroORM lives only in adapters
- Prefer `*.repository.adapter.ts` names (ORM-agnostic), not `mikro-*.ts`
- Import decorators from `@mikro-orm/decorators/legacy` in Nest apps
- Register `MikroOrmPersistenceModule` from bootstrap; use `MikroOrmModule.forFeature` when needed
